The '''sabre-toothed kyatt''' is a creature that players can capture with the [[Hunter]] skill at level 55 or above with [[Hunter#Pitfall trapping|pitfall trapping]], granting 300 Hunter [[experience]]. Sabre-toothed kyatts may be assigned as a [[Hunters' Rumours|hunters' rumour task]] by Guild Hunters [[Huntmaster Gilman (Novice)|Gilman]], [[Guild Hunter Ornus (Adept)|Ornus]], [[Guild Hunter Aco (Expert)|Aco]], or [[Guild Hunter Teco (Expert)|Teco]].

Although sabre-toothed kyatts have a [[combat level]] of 60, they are non-attackable. They can, however, attack [[player]]s once provoked with a [[teasing stick]] or [[hunter's spear]], dealing up to 7 melee damage.

Catching one is a requirement for the [[Fremennik Diary#Hard|Hard Fremennik Diary]].

When caught, they can drop [[kyatt fur]] or [[tatty kyatt fur]], which can be used to make [[kyatt hunter gear]]. Kyatt fur (not tatty kyatt fur) can also be used for upgrading the [[Medium fur pouch]] to the [[Large fur pouch]] which increases the capacity from 21 furs to 28 furs.

